      "sourceTextSha256": "61bb6d912a024b27e29053b88282e5b79705cc2a3a5b717ae0df736d0fe10093",
      "text": "Day 4 · A free day, or optional activities to enhance your island experience (see Optional activities). (Meals: B)\n\nFor those seeking additional adventure, these activities are available at an additional cost.\n\nMexico Rocks\n\nCrystal-clear waters, colourful coral formations and diverse fish species.\n\nCoral Gardens & manatees\n\nThe peaceful Coral Gardens, with a rare chance to encounter gentle manatees.\n\nSunset snorkelling\n\nSnorkel at dusk, as the soft glow of the setting sun lights up the water.",
